OL,3,GNEWSANew #632m contract to change
OL,4,Arubbish collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe councils said they had carried out
OL,7,Fa review of collection services and
OL,8,Fwould be making changes to how
OL,9,Ffrequently streets were cleaned and a
OL,10,Fnew bookable service to collect small
OL,11,Felectrical items, batteries and
OL,12,Ftextiles.
